# Keep Docker build context clean — a stale host `.next` copied into the
# image can make `next build` skip/miss new App Router pages & API routes
# (seen in prod: /dashboard/pos/reports/profit OK, /transactions 404).
.next
node_modules
out
build
coverage
.git
.gitlab
**/.DS_Store
*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
storage/uploads
storage/private
tools/pos-nfc-bridge/node_modules
docs
Panduan
.aider*
assistant-memory
*.traineddata
